{"id":"z03-20","volume":3,"volumeTitle":"周纪三","volumeSubtitle":"前301","index":20,"title":{"t":"赧王十四年","s":"赧王十四年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀三 · 前301 · 庚申","s":"周纪三 · 前301 · 庚申"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"这一天发生日食，太阳整个被遮住。","tokens":[{"t":"日","s":"日","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"有","s":"有","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"食","s":"食","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"既","s":"既","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦军把韩国的穰地占了下来。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"穰","s":"穰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"蜀地的宁𪸩背叛秦国，秦国的司马错前去讨伐诛杀他。","tokens":[{"t":"蜀","s":"蜀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"寧","s":"宁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"煇","s":"𪸩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"叛","s":"叛","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"司","s":"司","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"馬","s":"马","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"錯","s":"错","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"往","s":"往","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"誅","s":"诛","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国庶长奂会合韩、魏、齐的军队攻打楚国，在重丘打败楚军，杀死楚将唐昧，于是占领重丘。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"庶","s":"庶","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"長","s":"长","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"奐","s":"奂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"會","s":"会","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"兵","s":"兵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"敗","s":"败","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"師","s":"师","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"重","s":"重","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丘","s":"丘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"殺","s":"杀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"將","s":"将","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"唐","s":"唐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"昧","s":"昧","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"遂","s":"遂","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"重","s":"重","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"丘","s":"丘","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"赵王攻打中山，中山的国君逃往齐国。","tokens":[{"t":"趙","s":"赵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"伐","s":"伐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"中","s":"中","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"山","s":"山","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"中","s":"中","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"山","s":"山","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"君","s":"君","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"奔","s":"奔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周赧王十四年是公元前301年。这一年有全日食。秦夺取韩的穰。蜀地的宁𪸩反叛，司马错前往诛杀。秦庶长奂会合韩、魏、齐伐楚，在重丘打败楚军，杀死楚将唐昧，占领重丘。赵武灵王再次攻中山，中山君逃往齐国。楚在重丘大败，中山君主也流亡在外。","theme":"四国伐楚是楚的大败：主将唐昧死在重丘，重丘落入敌手。秦同时还在韩地取穰，并派司马错平定蜀中叛乱的宁𪸩。赵国则把中山君赶到齐国。这些地名和人名要记住，因为下一年楚怀王改向齐送太子求和，中山君也已经逃到齐国，不能再留在国内。","technique":"典型的短编年，一句一事，没有对话，也没有「臣光曰」。日食用「既」标出全食。其余都靠取、叛、诛、会、败、杀、奔这些动词顺次排开。四国军队只通过庶长奂一句带出，楚的失败集中在重丘和唐昧。中山君出奔单独成句，与楚事并列，不加议论。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"既","reading":"jì","note":"食尽。日食时太阳全部被遮，叫做既，也就是日全食。"},{"word":"诛","reading":"zhū","note":"讨伐并处死。司马错到蜀地是去诛杀宁𪸩。"},{"word":"叛","reading":"pàn","note":"背叛。宁𪸩在蜀地反秦。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"之","reading":"zhī","note":"「往诛之」的之指宁𪸩。"},{"word":"其","reading":"qí","note":"「其师」「其将」的其都指楚。败的是楚军，杀的是楚将唐昧。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"兵","note":"「韩、魏、齐兵」的兵是军队，不是一件兵器。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"日有食之","note":"编年记载日食的固定说法。这里的有不是拥有，之也不另指一件东西。"}]}}
